---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="Supporters — The Forktree Project" description="Many thanks to the organisations who generously support The Forktree Project.">

  <!-- Hero Banner -->
  <section class="supp-section supp-section--hero" style="background-image: url('/images/supporters/supporters-hero.jpg'); background-color: #2a3a2a;">
    <div class="supp-section__content supp-section__content--center">
      <div class="supp-text supp-text--wide">
        <h1>Supporters</h1>
        <p>Many thanks to the following organisations for their generous support:</p>

        <h3 class="supp-label">Principal Sponsors:</h3>
        <ul class="supp-list">
          <li>CHU</li>
          <li>Fleet Space Technologies</li>
          <li>FNPW</li>
          <li>Bank Australia</li>
          <li>Planet Wild</li>
          <li>Terra Artemis Foundation</li>
          <li>South Australia Government</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="supp-label">Supporters:</h3>
        <ul class="supp-list">
          <li>Lamb &amp; Walters</li>
          <li>Botanic Gardens of SA</li>
          <li>Australian Geographic</li>
          <li>Regenerate Australia</li>
          <li>Wild Pacific Media</li>
          <li>Lehane Giving Fund</li>
          <li>Murray Business Solutions</li>
          <li>Snow Legal</li>
          <li>BCB</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="supp-section__scroll">
      <svg width="20" height="12" viewBox="0 0 20 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <path d="M1 1L10 10L19 1" stroke="white" stroke-width="2"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Advisory Supporters -->
  <section class="supp-advisory">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="supp-advisory__text">We are also grateful to the following organisations for their specialist advisory support.</p>
      <p class="supp-advisory__text">If you are interested in providing guidance or support to The Forktree Project, please contact us.</p>
      <div class="supp-logos supp-logos--light">
        <img src="/images/supporters/advisory-supporters.png" alt="Advisory supporter logos" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <section class="supp-testimonials" style="background-image: url('/images/supporters/supporters-hero.jpg'); background-color: #1a2a1a;">
    <div class="supp-section__content supp-section__content--center">
      <div class="supp-testimonials__wrap">
        <h1>Testimonials</h1>
        <div class="supp-testimonials__grid">

          <blockquote class="supp-tcard" data-testimonial>
            <div class="supp-tcard__body">
              <div class="supp-tcard__collapsed">
                <p class="supp-tcard__pullquote">&ldquo;A perfect choice for students from Reception through to Year 12.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="supp-tcard__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;The Forktree Project provides students and teachers alike with a hands-on understanding around the importance of maintaining and developing our native biodiversity. On site students learn by doing, concreting ideas of sustainability, circular economy and carbon sequestration, all under the tutelage of a highly skilled and knowledgeable team. <span class="supp-tcard__highlight">A perfect choice for students from Reception through to Year 12.</span>&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="supp-tcard__cite">&mdash; Blackwood High School</cite>
              <button class="supp-tcard__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="supp-tcard" data-testimonial>
            <div class="supp-tcard__body">
              <div class="supp-tcard__collapsed">
                <p class="supp-tcard__pullquote">&ldquo;Learning doesn&rsquo;t get any more hands-on and tangible than this!&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="supp-tcard__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Visiting The Forktree Project with our Year 8 cohort is one of the most hands-on and valuable excursions I have attended. Our students absolutely thrived while working under the guidance of Tim and Liz and their team. The students learnt about sustainability and circular economy by getting stuck into some hard work and our school is incredibly lucky to have a relationship with The Forktree Project. <span class="supp-tcard__highlight">Learning doesn&rsquo;t get any more hands-on and tangible than this!</span>&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="supp-tcard__cite">&mdash; Tatachilla Lutheran College</cite>
              <button class="supp-tcard__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="supp-tcard" data-testimonial>
            <div class="supp-tcard__body">
              <div class="supp-tcard__collapsed">
                <p class="supp-tcard__pullquote">&ldquo;An effective platform for students to think globally and act locally.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="supp-tcard__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Liz and Tim work tirelessly to promote and support efforts to protect the integrity of our environment. Their important vision has attracted a multidisciplinary team who are committed to combatting climate change through encouraging sustainable practices, restoring habitat through rewilding and focusing on sequestration. Forktree enables students to participate in a range of tasks that show them they are quite literally planting the seeds of a greener future &mdash; a concrete, tangible means of combatting climate anxiety among the next generation. Our school will continue visiting Forktree to supplement students&rsquo; environmental education with practical application. <span class="supp-tcard__highlight">The Forktree Project offers an effective platform for students to think globally and act locally.</span> It is a relationship we are proud of and look forward to seeing thrive.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="supp-tcard__cite">&mdash; Prince Alfred College</cite>
              <button class="supp-tcard__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="supp-tcard" data-testimonial>
            <div class="supp-tcard__body">
              <div class="supp-tcard__collapsed">
                <p class="supp-tcard__pullquote">&ldquo;It was their favourite learning activity for the year!&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="supp-tcard__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Our students have expressed their excitement and satisfaction with the project, with students commenting that <span class="supp-tcard__highlight">it was their favourite learning activity for the year!</span> We are grateful for the opportunity to be part of The Forktree Project and look forward to continuing our involvement in the future. We wholeheartedly endorse this initiative and encourage other schools to participate and experience the benefits for themselves.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="supp-tcard__cite">&mdash; Adelaide Botanic High School</cite>
              <button class="supp-tcard__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="supp-tcard" data-testimonial>
            <div class="supp-tcard__body">
              <div class="supp-tcard__collapsed">
                <p class="supp-tcard__pullquote">&ldquo;The Forktree Project has been transformative.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="supp-tcard__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;<span class="supp-tcard__highlight">Annesley&rsquo;s collaboration with The Forktree Project has been transformative.</span> The bespoke extended program developed by The Forktree Project not only addressed our specific outcomes but also gave students a sense of ownership of the Carrickalinga site. The sequential approach has undoubtedly left a lasting mark on our students giving them confidence when leading their peers through various experiences related to the amazing work that the Forktree Project team are doing.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="supp-tcard__cite">&mdash; Annesley Junior School</cite>
              <button class="supp-tcard__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

          <blockquote class="supp-tcard" data-testimonial>
            <div class="supp-tcard__body">
              <div class="supp-tcard__collapsed">
                <p class="supp-tcard__pullquote">&ldquo;Tim and Liz are incredible ambassadors and live by example.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <div class="supp-tcard__expanded">
                <p>&ldquo;Operation Flinders Next Step program absolutely loved our time at Forktree &mdash; it was eye-opening for the young people to see what is being achieved by the project and to have the ability to engage in a practical, hands-on, real-life effort. To be able to camp onsite at such a beautiful location was amazing and the young people loved being able to go for walks, do yoga and immerse themselves in the beautiful surroundings. <span class="supp-tcard__highlight">Tim and Liz are incredible ambassadors and live by example</span>, working hard alongside the young people.&rdquo;</p>
              </div>
              <cite class="supp-tcard__cite">&mdash; Operation Flinders</cite>
              <button class="supp-tcard__toggle" type="button">Read full testimonial &rarr;</button>
            </div>
          </blockquote>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>

<style>
  .supp-section--hero,
  .supp-testimonials {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: scroll;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .supp-section--hero::before,
  .supp-testimonials::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 45%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0%, transparent 100%),
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .supp-section__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1600px;
    padding: 180px 100px;
  }

  .supp-section__content--center {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .supp-text {
    max-width: 50%;
    position: relative;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
  }

  .supp-text--wide {
    max-width: 80%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .supp-text h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .supp-text > p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .supp-label {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2.4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .supp-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .supp-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.2vw, 1.05rem);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .supp-logos {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .supp-logos img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Advisory (light bg) */
  .supp-advisory {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
    text-align: center;
    background: white;
  }

  .supp-advisory__text {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .supp-logos--light {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  /* Testimonials — card style matching corporate events */
  .supp-testimonials__wrap {
    max-width: 900px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .supp-testimonials__grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .supp-tcard {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-radius: 10px;
    border-left: none;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .supp-tcard__body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.8;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .supp-tcard__body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .supp-tcard__pullquote {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-style: italic;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .supp-tcard__collapsed {
    display: block;
  }

  .supp-tcard__expanded {
    display: none;
  }

  .supp-tcard--open .supp-tcard__collapsed {
    display: none;
  }

  .supp-tcard--open .supp-tcard__expanded {
    display: block;
  }

  .supp-tcard--open .supp-tcard__toggle {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .supp-tcard__highlight {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 1;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
  }

  .supp-tcard__toggle {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .supp-tcard__toggle:hover {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  }

  .supp-tcard__cite {
    display: block;
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.3vw, 1.1rem);
    opacity: 0.7;
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .supp-section__scroll {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 30px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 2;
    opacity: 0.7;
    animation: bounceDown 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes bounceDown {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(8px); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .supp-section--hero,
    .supp-testimonials {
      background-attachment: scroll;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .supp-section__content {
      padding: 100px 30px;
    }

    .supp-text,
    .supp-text--wide {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.supp-tcard__toggle').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const card = btn.closest('[data-testimonial]');
      if (card) {
        const isOpen = card.classList.toggle('supp-tcard--open');
        btn.innerHTML = isOpen ? '&larr; Show less' : 'Read full testimonial &rarr;';
      }
    });
  });
</script>
